title: Scripting in Lua
flow: A dozen lines of Lua add a palette command and a statusline chip; run the file from the palette and both appear at once.
copy assets/todos.lua todos.lua
open todos.lua
until "mnml.command"
record
wait 2500
key ctrl+a
wait 500
# script.run_selection: the selected lines run in the script state
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 300
slowtype "lua: run the selected" 55
wait 600
key enter
wait 2400
key ctrl+p
wait 250
slowtype "main.zig" 70
key enter
until "fn main"
wait 1800
key ctrl+shift+p
wait 300
slowtype "count the todo and fixme" 50
wait 700
poster
key enter
wait 3200
